SUMMARY:✨Cosmic Quietude: Astrology & Gong Meditation✨
DESCRIPTION:Star Sounds Asheville\n**Sunday October 4th 2:00-3:30 PM at Qu
 ietude Sanctuary\, Black Mountain**\n\nJoin astrologer and sound practitio
 ner **David Heiss of Star Sounds** for a nourishing Sunday afternoon desig
 ned to help you align with the rhythms of the cosmos while settling deeply
  into stillness\, presence\, and restoration.\nEach gathering begins with 
 a **20-minute Astrology Transmission**\, exploring the current planetary t
 ransits and the deeper themes moving through the collective and our person
 al lives. Through an evolutionary and soul-centered lens\, David offers pr
 actical and inspiring insights to help you consciously navigate the energi
 es of the week ahead.\nFrom there\, participants will be guided into a **4
 5-minute Gong Sound Journey**. Surrounded by the resonant tones of planeta
 ry gongs\, singing bowls\, and sacred sound instruments\, you'll be invite
 d into a meditative state where the thinking mind can soften\, the nervous
  system can unwind\, and a deeper connection to Self can emerge.\nWhether 
 you are seeking relaxation\, spiritual insight\, emotional renewal\, or si
 mply a quiet place to rest and reconnect\, this weekly experience offers a
  sacred pause from the busyness of everyday life.\n\n**🙏Donations Start
  at $33-Please give more if you can. If $33 is to much\, just email David 
 at [david@starsounds.love](mailto:david@starsounds.love) for a special pri
 ce🙏**\n\n### 👤 **About David Heiss**\n\nDavid Heiss is an **Evolutio
 nary Astrologer and Sound Alchemist** devoted to guiding himself and other
 s into deeper self-awareness through vibration and cosmic insight.\nSince 
 2012\, he has worked with the transformative power of **gongs and astrolog
 y**\, following a profound awakening that shifted his life toward a path o
 f healing and inner discovery.\nHis work blends:\n\n* **Astrological intel
 ligence** (understanding your soul’s path)\n* **Sound immersion** (direc
 t vibrational experience)\n\nCreating a space where participants can **rem
 ember who they are on a deeper level**.\nHis intention is simple and preci
 se: to help you **experience yourself more fully**.\n\n**🧘‍♂️Plea
 se bring your own "sound healing nest"** including blankets\, pillows\, bo
 lsters\, or any other comforts that will support you in resting deeply dur
 ing the journey. **Yoga mats are provided by Quietude.**\nCome settle into
  stillness\, attune to the wisdom of the heavens\, and allow the medicine 
 of sound to carry you home to yourself.\n*"As above\, so within."*
